    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c339eb0d648c3da3f6fbfb32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "具有激发不可思议力量的能力。\\n可用于支援卡的强化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a60499d82f0641cf1c4d51d1fcbe3aed789c9b0d5f1fd13a5df0be690ab980",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f602f2aee95415b5f97a2ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可进行支援卡抽奖的抽奖券。\\n可在奖池一览中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5874eebfc83c281a99469eddbaca1599089b4ccdb05f0b57e6696560f2537211",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfe3395fca596db74fbe6c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可在★3必得赛马娘奖池第１R\\n进行抽奖的抽奖券。可在奖池一览中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c34d1c98af6a5994dcbb53265743a5255604ecb15f83023c4d225445664ce66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01aa3086fb90f2b50baf534f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可在SSR必得支援卡奖池第１R\\n进行抽奖的抽奖券。可在奖池一览中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "501b174327b8c335e2e3eea634ef64ede5d67d5bbdc4b473cecc3c171fb544f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03cad16b792b483a689a167",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "据说能获得三女神的祝福。\\n在商店可以兑换各种各样的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d5d5097e6a7d72e6a00bcc600dad0e8e73f37e67c5708a4823cae2166ba82ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd9c9abf6b157f7951c4cc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将赛马娘的干劲变为绝好调。\\n可在团队竞技场等场合中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a683af0def98ee38dd2babf91101e68d86004db7150ec4fec47ac747b605cd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:032b1445b6887a11bb66eed0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将天气变为「晴」，马场状态变为「良」。\\n可在团队竞技场等场合中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ed39b7307d5e9a03db01e514bcf9770c5cab9da13c46f545ca5c9cdd1a9a1fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89fe0a0091851af15940d03f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将天气变为「雨」，马场状态变为「不良」。\\n可在团队竞技场等场合中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b16d46e616b20617d3bd34fd992ac0569a9f100aea899cd2df80f910fd7e50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad36b54f4b483a484e400120",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将枠号变为内圈（1～3号）。\\n可在团队竞技场等场合中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0bda73be7357dff03e3d7dc966a7c1b1be27cdcab07685e4551ced197327c94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7f0aa50aef94bab5a55b244",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将枠号变为外圈（6～8号）。\\n可在团队竞技场等场合中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b001c469c7dc6e16467beb6571487e7bbaa23d774a23a3ff06d38260c447c49e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0200f0cad225ad68b888f9f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便在沙土中打闹也不会弄脏的\\n「不沾土」名牌产品。可用于觉醒等级强化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c30222f1bef626190afdf1463f63a1020a35f98745fa873f0eeb2474f0484f6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36bcd1829c3b9887fe31b33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在名单中选出你喜欢的赛马娘\\n可以用于兑换★3育成赛马娘的兑换券。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72a355f89d03b2f3ffb38b2063da42a51b73f2d158372f07a9de81139dc7bdb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5303577092d9774fe4e68e36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在名单中选出你喜欢的支援卡\\n可以用于兑换SSR支援卡的兑换券。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3adab6c2762fdda3012cd48586ec09aee7d93897e33a7789b1ddab530650c172",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:636e7b3cb683f5f84a8e4341",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你所需要的正是关注数！\\n可增加一个关注栏位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac6f0e8be70de1653294f3cfd5631538dcf639f27c173001ab06609939bca758",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d9aadf9bfa7ee2fb640834",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用于解开与赛马娘之间的回忆的书签。\\n可解锁过去举办的剧情活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b85995f105c67473020ef313d83fdcaf7efb27f281f019ee086c08c6204fa960",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63a8e04b3d6af6ba53f9ade",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行训练员工作所获得的奖励。\\n在商店可以兑换各种各样的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a5193186b5f9539191f617b8273644351a9a5129e30b3023ab57f38be86f30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "24",
        "134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5943b891132767f614c4fdf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "★2以上必得赛马娘奖池第１Rが引ける\\nチケット。可在奖池一览中使用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3e569d1b83a6c0f589e6acf1a5e124482826e8ed03f97eea2152806aafb0af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
